          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A direct alias works as soon as it’s typed; otherwise type it followed by a space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接別名在輸入後立即生效；否則請在輸入後加上空格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A file's type comes from its extension. Extensions macOS doesn't know (.rs, .go, .kt…) are declared by MacToys; another app declaring them differently wins for its own files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "檔案類型取決於其副檔名。macOS 不認得的副檔名（.rs、.go、.kt⋯）由 MacToys 宣告；若其他 App 以不同方式宣告，該 App 自己的檔案會以其宣告為準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A format with this name already exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已有使用此名稱的格式。"
