    "Executable files here become commands. Header lines like “%@”, “%@”, “%@” and “%@” set the title, icon, how output shows and an argument. Raycast script headers work too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Executable files here become commands. Header lines like “%1$@”, “%2$@”, “%3$@” and “%4$@” set the title, icon, how output shows and an argument. Raycast script headers work too."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此處的可執行檔案會成為指令。「%1$@」、「%2$@」、「%3$@」和「%4$@」等標頭行可設定標題、圖像、輸出的顯示方式和引數。Raycast 工序指令標頭也適用。"
          }
        }
      }
