    "External monitors are controlled over DDC/CI on Apple silicon; the built-in display and Apple displays use macOS's own brightness control. Many USB-C/Thunderbolt docks and DisplayLink adapters don't pass DDC/CI through. Rotation isn't offered: macOS has no public API to rotate a display — use System Settings › Displays › Rotation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Apple 晶片上，外接顯示器透過 DDC/CI 控制；內建顯示器和 Apple 顯示器則使用 macOS 本身的亮度控制。許多 USB-C/Thunderbolt 擴充基座和 DisplayLink 轉接器不會傳遞 DDC/CI。不提供旋轉功能：macOS 沒有可旋轉顯示器的公開 API — 請使用「系統設定」›「顯示器」›「旋轉」。"
          }
