        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 %1$@ 並按下 %2$@，即可在你正在使用的 App 的視窗之間跳躍切換"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold a button still to keep it held after you let go; drag, then click any button to release.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住按鈕不動，放開後仍會保持按住；拖移後按一下任一按鈕即可放開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold a letter and tap Space or an arrow key to type accented characters.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住字母並點按空白鍵或方向鍵，即可輸入重音字元。"
