            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連續組合鍵等待第二個按鍵的時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long the letter and the activation key must stay down before the toolbar opens. Quicker presses type normally, so fast typing isn't affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字母和啟用鍵必須按住多久才會打開工具列。較快的按壓會正常輸入，因此不會影響快速打字。"
          }
