    "If another app (for example a Markdown or source-code previewer) claims the same type, macOS uses only one of them. Turn the other off in System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions › Quick Look.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若其他 App（例如 Markdown 或原始碼預覽程式）宣告了相同的類型，macOS 只會使用其中一個。請在「系統設定」›「一般」›「登入項目與延伸功能」›「快速查看」中關閉另一個。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it’s already running": {
