        }
      }
    },
    "It adds the MacToys submenu (PowerRename, Image Resizer, File Locksmith, Peek) and New+ to Finder’s context menu. Turn it on under File Providers & Finder Extensions.": {
      "comment": "“File Providers & Finder Extensions” is the System Settings pane: use its name in macOS",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會將 MacToys 子選單（PowerRename、影像大小調整器、檔案佔用檢查器、Peek）和 New+ 加入 Finder 的快速選單。請在「檔案提供者與 Finder 延伸功能」中開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stops immediately; unsaved work is lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
