            "value": "再按一次可在其持續執行時隱藏或顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press again to lock all Macs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再按一次以鎖定所有 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press again to stop and save.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再按一次以停止並儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press and hold the letter": {
      "comment": "Quick Accent activation: no extra key",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住字母"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press duration": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按壓持續時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press once: a line sweeps across; press again to slow it, again to fix it, then the same for the other direction; the last press clicks. Esc cancels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按一次：一條線會掃過畫面；再按一次讓它變慢，再按一次將它固定，接著以同樣方式處理另一個方向；最後一次按下會按一下滑鼠。按 Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
