    "R G B Y O P colors (⇧ highlighter) · X blur · hold ⇧ line, ⌃ rectangle, Tab ellipse, ⌃⇧ arrow · T text · ⌘Z undo · E erase all · W whiteboard · K blackboard · Space centers the pointer · ⌘C copy, ⌘S save (⇧ to crop)": {
      "comment": "Single capital letters are the keys to press (R G B Y O P, X, T, E, W, K); keep them. Tab and Space are the keys of that name.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "R G B Y O P 顏色（⇧ 螢光筆）· X 模糊 · 按住 ⇧ 直線、⌃ 矩形、Tab 橢圓形、⌃⇧ 箭頭 · T 文字 · ⌘Z 還原 · E 全部擦除 · W 白板 · K 黑板 · 空白鍵將指標置中 · ⌘C 拷貝、⌘S 儲存（⇧ 裁切）"
