      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新對應"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remaps that need the event tap don’t apply in secure text fields (passwords) or at the login window. Keys are matched by position, so remaps keep working when you switch keyboard layouts. App-specific remaps use bundle identifiers and win over global ones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要事件監聽的重新對應不適用於安全文字欄位（密碼）或登入視窗。按鍵是依位置比對，因此切換鍵盤佈局時重新對應仍會持續運作。App 專屬的重新對應使用 Bundle 識別碼，並優先於全域重新對應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
