    "Switches right away; the schedule resumes at its next change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即切換；排程會在下次變更時恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching inputs over DDC/CI can leave the screen black if the new input has no signal, and software control may be unavailable until you switch back with the monitor's buttons. Not every monitor exposes all inputs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若新的輸入沒有訊號，透過 DDC/CI 切換輸入可能會讓螢幕變黑，且在你使用顯示器的按鈕切換回來之前可能無法透過軟體控制。並非每台顯示器都提供所有輸入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching to one brings it back from the Dock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切換到其中一個即可將其從 Dock 恢復"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "comment": "File Locksmith: shown instead of End process for system processes\nProvider name and row label: system commands (lock, sleep, restart…)\nText font: the system font\nTheme: follow the system appearance",
