    "localhost should point to a loopback address (127.0.0.1 or ::1)": {
      "comment": "Hosts entry problem; localhost is a host name, keep it as is",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "localhost 應指向回送位址（127.0.0.1 或 ::1）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "login item": {
      "comment": "Workspace summary: it launches at login",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登入項目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS asks once per capability.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 對每項功能只會詢問一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS can't place one app's window inside another. When you click an interactive crop, the original window moves so the cropped area sits exactly under the crop and comes to the front; when you switch away, the crop returns.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 無法將一個 App 的視窗放在另一個 App 的視窗內。當你按一下互動式裁切時，原始視窗會移動，讓裁切的區域正好位於裁切視窗下方並移到最前面；當你切換到其他位置時，裁切視窗就會回來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS doesn't let one app float another app's windows, so a pinned window is kept in front by a live mirror while you work elsewhere. Pointing at it brings the real window forward in place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 不允許一個 App 讓另一個 App 的視窗浮在最上層，因此當你在其他地方工作時，釘選的視窗會以即時鏡像保持在前方。指向它即可將真正的視窗原地移到前面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS has no MP3 encoder. Install ffmpeg or LAME (brew install lame) to transcode to .mp3, or use .m4a.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 沒有 MP3 編碼器。請安裝 ffmpeg 或 LAME（brew install lame）以轉碼為 .mp3，或改用 .m4a。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS has one appearance for the system and apps, so Light Switch always changes both. Choosing a mode in System Settings › Appearance (including Auto) works alongside it; Light Switch turns Auto off when it switches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 的系統和 App 共用同一種外觀，因此外觀切換一律會同時更改兩者。在「系統設定」›「外觀」中選擇模式（包括「自動」）可與其並用；外觀切換在切換時會關閉「自動」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS keyboard shortcuts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 鍵盤快速鍵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS normally draws PDF thumbnails itself; this one is used only where it doesn't": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 通常會自行繪製 PDF 縮覽圖；只有在 macOS 不繪製時才會使用此項"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS protects %@. Chrome-family bookmarks work without it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 會保護 %@。Chrome 系列的書籤不需要此權限即可使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS's path_helper (/etc/zprofile) moves system folders to the front in Terminal's login shells. This re-applies PATH-like variables from ~/.zprofile afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 的 path_helper（/etc/zprofile）會在「終端機」的登入 shell 中將系統檔案夾移到最前面。此選項會在之後重新套用 ~/.zprofile 中的類 PATH 變數。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "manifest request failed": {
